  "thag1.3:1.1": "Paññaṃ imaṃ passa tathāgatānaṃ: ",
  "thag1.3:1.2": "aggi yathā pajjalito nisīthe ",
  "thag1.3:1.3": "ālokadā cakkhudadā bhavanti ",
  "thag1.3:1.4": "ye āgatānaṃ vinayanti kaṅkhan ti. ",
  "thag1.3:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā Kaṅkhārevato thero gātham abhāsittha. Sabbhir eva "
}
